At export time there would never be an **unexisting _implementation() funciton** because only exports to windows and linux, if mac is ever added, the error will appear, and coder will have to add it.
This is much better than having a foced empty implementation that does nothing, and then when you add mac 5 months latter you wonder why the implementation is not doing what is should.

